ALVA — ASPERITAS STAGE & 24-STAGE ROSTER OVERHAUL

Complete Implementation Specification

Primary objective

Implement a complete stage-selection overhaul and introduce a fully playable third stage named Asperitas into the existing Alva game.

This update has two major components:

1. Completely redesign the Stage Selection interface to support a permanent roster of 24 stage slots, including a dedicated Random Stage button.
2. Create Asperitas, a sky-themed fighting arena consisting of one large stationary cloud platform and two smaller independently behaving cloud-platform hazards.

The two smaller clouds must move, idle, disappear, and reappear according to their own randomized behavior systems. Crucially, when a cloud disappears, it must reappear at a newly randomized position within its permitted region, rather than automatically returning to its previous position.

The three playable cloud platforms must never collide or physically overlap.

This must be implemented as a polished, working expansion to the existing game. Do not deliver a mockup, prototype, or partial implementation.

