Highest-priority rules

Rule 1 — Independent randomness

Cloud A and Cloud B must each control their own states, movement, timers, and disappearance cycles.

Rule 2 — Random reappearance

After disappearing, a cloud must reappear at a newly randomized valid position. It must not be restricted to returning to the position where it disappeared.

